        <mxCell id="27" value="&lt;b&gt;Acceptance signal&lt;/b&gt;&#xa;Material Editor exposes the only Canvas-facing Component Mapping control; Model/Header exposes none. Cancel selector → 0 mutations. Confirm MES → zero aliases persist as CH3 / CH4O / H2SO4. Save/reload, duplicate, workbook + full export/import, generated variables, and material_fractions contain canonical names only." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=16;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;fontSize=13;" vertex="1" parent="1">
